  "content": "<p>此函式庫模組為下列模組所必需，詳見：<a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/CyclopsMC</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>歡迎在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/9yDxubB\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cyclops Discord 伺服器</a>的 #cyclopscore 頻道與我們交流！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此模組允許您透過 XML 宣告自訂合成配方，更多資訊請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC/CyclopsCore/wiki/Recipe-XML\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC/packages/packages/\" rel=\"nofollow\">開發版本</a>以 GitHub 套件形式發佈。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此模組會收集<a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC/CyclopsCore/blob/master-1.9/src/main/java/org/cyclops/cyclopscore/tracking/Analytics.java\" rel=\"nofollow\">匿名啟動資料</a>，可在設定檔中停用，並遵循 Minecraft 的 snooper 設定。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcyclops\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/banner/console-affiliation-banners/banner_abd7c360-8f9d-4395-8382-b28f26a2d6b2.png\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a><br>在 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcyclops\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 租用伺服器時，使用推薦碼 <strong>cyclops</strong> 支援我們，即可享<strong>首月 75 折優惠</strong>！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kroeser\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c14.patreon.com/Patreon_Wordmark_fb38c295a1.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"56\"></a><br>如果您喜歡此模組，歡迎在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kroeser\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 上贊助我！</p>",
